From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dwrite: download queue, justification, vertical orientation, fallback mappings, axis names, glyph images (3543)

dwrite: download queue, justification, vertical orientation, fallback mappings, axis names, glyph images

IDWriteFactory3::GetFontDownloadQueue returns a per-factory queue (listeners, empty, generation 0); the update-check
flags of the system and EUDC collections are accepted silently. IDWriteTextAnalyzer1 AnalyzeVerticalGlyphOrientation
(Vertical_Orientation approximation), GetJustificationOpportunities, JustifyGlyphAdvances, GetJustifiedGlyphs (no kashida).
IDWriteFontFallbackBuilder::AddMappings copies the mappings of a system or custom fallback, IDWriteFontFallback1::MapCharacters
with axis values. The layout's text source answers GetNumberSubstitution/GetVerticalGlyphOrientation. IDWriteFontResource
GetAxisNames/GetAxisValueNameCount/GetAxisValueNames (fvar names, STAT formats 1-3). IDWriteFontFace4 GetGlyphImageFormats
per glyph and ppem range, GetGlyphImageData/ReleaseGlyphImageData for sbix PNG/JPEG/TIFF, CBDT PNG and SVG documents.
IDWriteTextLayout4 Set/GetFontAxisValues(+Count) per text range, applied when the run face is chosen.
